# Scratch fixtures for the verifier checks; generated per run and removed after.
.heddle-tmp/

# A session's definition folder is written by heddle into the branch it ran in, and the owner asked on
# 2026-10-12 that it be **kept locally and kept out of the repository**: one folder per session is machine
# state, not project content. The transcript already lives outside every repository under ~/.heddle/sessions;
# this line keeps the readable half out of commits too, while leaving both on disk.
_sessions_/
